WEBVTT

00:00:01.290 --> 00:00:02.345
Hi, I'm Fern!

00:00:02.345 --> 00:00:06.563
mini-AGI is a byte-level model that trains on one laptop card and

00:00:06.563 --> 00:00:07.970
grows its own experts.

00:00:09.225 --> 00:00:10.511
Experts live on disk.

00:00:10.511 --> 00:00:14.367
A slow router loads thirty-two, a fast one picks eight per character,

00:00:14.367 --> 00:00:15.653
and the pool grows.

00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.206
Every expert is a small MLP, a file on disk.

00:00:23.206 --> 00:00:25.930
The published snapshot had a hundred and sixty-nine.

00:00:26.350 --> 00:00:30.489
Once every two thousand and forty-eight characters, a slow segment router chooses

00:00:30.489 --> 00:00:32.558
which thirty-two sit on the card.

00:00:32.978 --> 00:00:36.267
Each character runs one shared block up to twenty-four times.

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:39.557
Each pass, a fast router picks eight of those thirty-two.

00:00:41.133 --> 00:00:44.567
In the project's own capture, each row is one pass; its eight

00:00:44.567 --> 00:00:46.570
tiles are the experts that pass ran.

00:00:46.990 --> 00:00:49.518
Each character takes about four to fourteen rows.

00:00:49.518 --> 00:00:52.362
The amber line marks where the halting head stopped.

00:00:53.692 --> 00:00:57.392
The pool adds at most one expert every two million characters, and

00:00:57.392 --> 00:00:58.933
brakes refuse about a third.

00:00:59.353 --> 00:01:01.696
A newborn isn't a clone or random.

00:01:01.696 --> 00:01:05.042
It's assembled from whole hidden units of sixteen trained parents.

00:01:05.462 --> 00:01:09.132
And an expert nothing loads for a hundred million characters is deleted,

00:01:09.132 --> 00:01:10.661
so the pool shrinks too.

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:15.904
Read half a million characters of chess, trunk at full rate, and

00:01:15.904 --> 00:01:19.033
seven unread subjects get two point two three nats worse.

00:01:19.453 --> 00:01:23.290
Slow only the trunk to a tenth, and forgetting falls below the

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:27.126
noise floor: the honest reading of zero point zero zero six seven.

00:01:28.808 --> 00:01:33.535
The finding is one multiplier: slow the trunk's learning rate, and forgetting

00:01:33.535 --> 00:01:35.504
goes from catastrophic to unmeasurable.

00:01:36.942 --> 00:01:40.845
To recap: a slow router pages experts in, a fast one picks

00:01:40.845 --> 00:01:42.796
eight, a slower trunk stops forgetting.

00:01:43.216 --> 00:01:45.229
Every source is in the full article.

00:01:45.229 --> 00:01:45.804
I'm Fern.

00:01:45.804 --> 00:01:46.092
Bye!
